  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '4. Drawing New Cards

    When you run out of available moves in the Tableau,
    tap the Stock pile to draw cards into the Waste. The top card of the Waste pile
    is always available to be played onto either the Tableau or the Foundations.
    Depending on your game settings, drawing will reveal cards 1 at a time or 3 at
    a time. Once the Stock is empty, tap it again to recycle the Waste back into
    a new draw pile.


    <b><size=+10>How To Win</size></b>

    You win the game
    when all 52 cards have been sorted into the foundation.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
