  m_text: '3. Building the Foundations

    Foundations are built in ascending order
    (Ace up to King) and must be separated by suit.


    As soon as an Ace becomes
    available in the Tableau or Waste, move it straight to an open Foundation spot.
    You can then stack the 2, 3, 4, and so on of that exact same suit on top of it.
    Cards can also be pulled back down from the Foundations into the Tableau if you
    need them to maneuver other columns!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
